From 5b0bb3102f3814debf2098ba00f737715b1acc24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 12:08:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [RDK][QMESH] handle topology notification and improve TLV
 parsing robustness

- Add support for TOPOLOGY_NOTIFICATION_MESSAGE in backhaul manager
  and topology task

- Implement topology notification handler:
  - Log incoming notification
  - Trigger TOPOLOGY_QUERY_MESSAGE to sender as per IEEE 1905.1 spec

- Allow topology discovery in RDKB builds even when controller is not discovered

- Improve TLV parsing in CmduMessageRx:
  - Skip zero-length TLVs (except End-of-Message)
  - Prevent buffer underflow issues in generated init() logic

Signed-off-by: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
